# Short, shareable URL for the brand lockup: luckypot.cc/logo
# Cloudflare Pages won't map an extensionless path to a .svg on its own, and
# _redirects only fires for paths that match no Function and no static asset -
# so /api/* and /app/* are untouched.
/logo   /logo-full.svg   302
/logo-dark   /logo-full-dark.svg   302

# /app/admin is NOT handled here. A rewrite rule (both exact-path and /app/*
# splat forms) consistently lost to Pages' own unmatched-path fallback, which
# serves the ROOT index.html (this landing page) instead of /app/index.html -
# reproduced even on the raw *.pages.dev domain, so it's a Pages platform
# behavior, not a zone-level rule. Fixed instead by giving build-site.mjs a
# literal dist-site/app/admin/index.html (a copy of the app shell) so Pages
# serves it as an ordinary static file, the same way it already serves
# /app/index.html - no redirect/rewrite involved at all.
